the edition) are published by the Western Australian Planning Commission and remain the
copyright of the State of Western Australia. This repository reproduces that text as a
derived, unofficial transcription for the purpose of demonstrating a machine-readable
edition; the published PDFs govern. See edition/GOVERNANCE.md.

